<title>SOUTH KOREA: S.Korean Shinhan Bank H1 net rises yr/yr.</title>
<headline>S.Korean Shinhan Bank H1 net rises yr/yr.</headline>
<dateline>SEOUL 1996-08-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to June 30</p>
<p>(in billion won unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (won)		 799     vs    613</p>
<p>    Net			  98.50  vs     75.46</p>
<p>    Profit before tax     128.69  vs    102.98</p>
<p>    Revenue		 1,127.63  vs    878.35</p>
<p>NOTE - Shinhan Bank is one of South Korea's leading commercial banks. The figures were released by the Korea Listed Companies Association.</p>
<p>--Seoul Newsroom (822) 727 5646</p>
</text>
